abstract: >-
  NOX is a governance and containment architecture for hostile agentic
  artificial intelligence, emphasizing deterministic control,
  non-bypassable enforcement, verification, auditability, and
  hardware-enforced human authority.
keywords:
  - agentic AI
  - AI containment
  - AI safety
  - AI security
  - systems architecture
  - deterministic control
  - AI governance
  - formal verification
